{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pulls/84","id":5452225257,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVpoYrs8AAAABRPpa6Q","html_url":"https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pull/84","diff_url":"https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pull/84.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pull/84.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/issues/84","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pulls/84/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pulls/84/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/issues/84/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/statuses/32b61d81e8fc942fdc51624949c56ac6cb4b53e0","number":84,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"R12.1：共同透视底稿与 V14 未通过试绘审查","user":{"login":"mechgouki","id":8364215,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjQyMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8364215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki","html_url":"https://github.com/mechgouki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 本轮解决什么\n\nR11.1 已给出共同坐标平面，但全景图尚不能稳定服从该平面的占地、层数与前后关系。本 PR 发布 R12.1 的共同透视依据和实际试绘审查，明确保留未通过结论。\n\n## 本次变化\n\n- 89 项来源几何、863 个顶点共用一套地面投影，交付整幅／永宁寺局部底稿、计层占位、第五次样张偏差核验及 9 项“判断—依据—图面变化”记录。\n- 保存 6 次真实生成图、原始提示词与独立审查。主显示仍为第 5 张；第 6 张、提示词与审查作为独立失败附录下载。\n- 新增 `luoyang-panorama-v14.html`，可切换 V12、V13 二修、V14 和前后并排；两首页增加明确标注“未通过”的入口。\n- 记录、页面、下载及验证结果均保持 `needs_revision / rejected_needs_revision`；阻断项在图片前显示，无脚本时仍可读。\n- 保留既有完整构建、旧文件字节保护和桌面／手机门禁，新增 V14 真正点击下载及原字节留存检查。\n\n## 研究结论与限制\n\n六张图均未接纳。主显示第五张的南门仍只有两层，门基／佛殿／寺墙位置和尺度未服从底稿；第六张没有解决这些问题。宫城二、三号门、两阙关系及大面积裸土表达仍待改绘。像素约读不是同名控制残差或考古误差。\n\n7 项候选绑定、0 个已核现场共同控制点；没有新增古代实测坐标、真方位、古岸线或已证上部建筑高度。516—528 年是综合研究窗口，不是同年实景证明。\n\n**首页继续使用已批准的 V12，`homepage_replacement_approved=false`。技术发布通过不等于图像通过，更不批准首页替换。**\n\n## 验证与发布\n\n已完成来源／几何独立复算、原 PNG 与审查身份、派生图校验、当前状态检查、339 项名录验证及发布合同独立代码复核。完整本地构建、R12 10 项及 R11 13 项检查已通过。首个 PR 运行在 R9 ZIP 篡改测试中因新增保护提前拒绝而触发报错文本不匹配；修复保留完整发布拒绝与 R9 内部证据精确拒绝两层断言，相关 R9／V13r2／R10 共 32 项本地通过。原失败运行与日志保留，随后提交重新执行完整 CI；该 PR 仍须通过规定 CI 的全部构建、旧回归和双端浏览器检查，生产须 `build → deploy → verify-live` 全部成功后才登记上线。\n\n按 AGENTS.md，最终将保存实际 tested merge／tree、生产 commit、Actions 报告长期副本和正式站回读结果，更新 #52 与 #47；两个长期研究 Issue 保持开放。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-23T11:30:43Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:40:02Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"531baa07af399f0ee647b95c44ab6695bd7303e4","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"mechgouki:feat/panorama-v14-spatial","ref":"feat/panorama-v14-spatial","repo":{"id":1452939438,"node_id":"R_kgDOVpoYrg","name":"luoyang-city","full_name":"mechgouki/luoyang-city","owner":{"login":"mechgouki","id":8364215,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjQyMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8364215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki","html_url":"https://github.com/mechgouki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/